  "comparison": [
    "Glass: about 42 soft dots of 46-53 px at 14% opacity and 4 brighter dots at 17%, under a 165-degree tint and a 118-degree sheen with a 1 px top highlight. No constellation lines.",
    "Layout: the dashboard tab bar, then one centred column about 760-880 px wide for the conversation screens. Run, workflow and settings screens use the dashboard's page width, up to 1320 px, and settings keep their own rail.",
    "Type: Archivo for prose, headings and controls; JetBrains Mono for ids, commands, numbers and status lines.",
    "Colour: the Forest palette with one accent, #F26A1B. Orange marks only what spends and what waits on the owner. Lanes and phase kinds differ by shape and fill, never by a colour of their own (D1, 2026-11-20).",
    "Voice: the owner's messages are bubbles; Marimba's replies are bare text on the glass.",
    "Owner acts: a button marked with a key glyph, signed by the owner's passkey, with the terminal line kept as the fallback. The phone and the Mac app show none as runnable.",
    "Numbers are not compared. Bracketed values are placeholders and the run data is illustrative."
  ],
